  "scope": "New authorized business action: per-SKU quotes. This is a separate version, not a change to frozen v5 results. The engine has exactly the same buyer response, incomes, needs, fees, returns, stock and consent rules; its only behavioral input change is an optional merchant price book. Quotes range75–125% of base, also respecting a20% pre-return margin. Limits are authored experiment assumptions, not PayPal policy. Outside-retailer prices remain immutable. All baselines can quote products; fixed family includes six uniform price plans and selects the strongest financially acceptable comparator on development. No paid calls or native payments.",
